WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.800
The Magic Barber by John Milne.

00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:19.610
It is afternoon in Crossways.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.992
Crossways is a quiet town.

00:00:23.052 --> 00:00:26.934
Crossways is a sleepy town.

00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:31.556
Everybody in Crossways wears a large hat.

00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:36.366
Everybody in Crossways wears a black hat.

00:00:36.426 --> 00:00:40.600
The women wear round, black hats.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.180
The men wear tall, black hats. 

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:48.300
The girls wear square, black hats. 

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.600
The boys wear flat, black hats. 

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:56.100
Everybody has long hair. 

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.800
Everybody wears a large hat. 

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:05.500
Everybody wears a large hat over their long hair. 

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.914
It is afternoon in Crossways.

00:01:10.974 --> 00:01:14.266
The sun is shining brightly.

00:01:14.326 --> 00:01:16.878
It is a hot afternoon.

00:01:16.938 --> 00:01:19.930
Everybody is sleeping.

00:01:19.989 --> 00:01:23.892
Suddenly there is a loud noise.

00:01:23.952 --> 00:01:26.293
Everybody wakes up.

00:01:26.353 --> 00:01:28.794
They all look round.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:30.966
What is happening?

00:01:31.026 --> 00:01:34.828
Who is making that loud noise?

00:01:34.888 --> 00:01:39.803
A small boy is walking along the street.

00:01:39.863 --> 00:01:42.896
He is beating a drum.

00:01:42.956 --> 00:01:47.772
The small boy is walking in front of a donkey.

00:01:47.831 --> 00:01:52.056
The donkey is pulling a cart.

00:01:52.116 --> 00:01:55.240
A man is sitting on the cart.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:59.199
There is a large notice above the man's head.

00:01:59.259 --> 00:02:01.486
THE MAGIC BARBER!

00:02:01.546 --> 00:02:03.258
WHY WEAR HATS?

00:02:03.318 --> 00:02:06.090
HAVE YOUR HAIR CUT! ALL SHAPES!

00:02:06.149 --> 00:02:07.640
ALL COLOURS!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:12.384
ONLY ONE DOLLAR! HURRY! HURRY! HURRY!
 
00:02:12.444 --> 00:02:15.586
Everybody reads the notice.

00:02:15.646 --> 00:02:19.359
Everybody in Crossways is happy.

00:02:19.419 --> 00:02:22.061
They don't like black hats.

00:02:22.121 --> 00:02:25.824
They don't want to wear hats any more.

00:02:25.884 --> 00:02:29.050
They all shout and cheer.

00:02:30.164 --> 00:02:37.700
Hurray! ...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.500
They all throw their hats in the air.

00:02:42.605 --> 00:02:46.900
The wind blows the hats high in the sky.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.100
The all cheer and shout.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:03:00.148
Goodbye hat! Goodbye hat! Goodbye hat! Nobody sees the small boy. He is busy.
 
00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:03.479
He is picking up the hats.

00:03:03.539 --> 00:03:09.720
The small boy is putting the hats into a large bag.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:14.942
He fills the large bag with the hats.

00:03:15.002 --> 00:03:20.162
The small boy lifts up the large bag.

00:03:20.222 --> 00:03:23.333
He runs out of the town.

00:03:23.393 --> 00:03:29.966
He is carrying the large bag on his back.

00:03:30.026 --> 00:03:35.810
A young man climbs onto the cart.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.772
He sits down on the chair.

00:03:38.832 --> 00:03:42.032
He pays the barber a dollar.

00:03:42.092 --> 00:03:49.145
The Magic Barber puts a large white towel over the young man's head.

00:03:49.205 --> 00:03:53.657
He holds a large pair of scissors in the air.

00:03:53.717 --> 00:03:56.759
He shouts the magic words.

00:03:56.819 --> 00:04:03.954
“Snip! Snip! Up and down! Round and round! And off it comes!”

00:04:04.014 --> 00:04:08.218
The Magic Barber pulls away the towel.

00:04:08.278 --> 00:04:10.579
Everybody shouts.

00:04:10.639 --> 00:04:14.342
The young man's hair is short.

00:04:14.402 --> 00:04:18.424
The young man's hair is green.

00:04:18.484 --> 00:04:22.226
Everybody shouts and cheers.

00:04:22.286 --> 00:04:30.900
Everybody is happy.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.895
The Magic Barber cuts everybody's hair.

00:04:35.955 --> 00:04:38.836
The women have blue hair.

00:04:38.896 --> 00:04:41.448
The men have green hair.

00:04:41.508 --> 00:04:44.219
The boys have red hair.

00:04:44.279 --> 00:04:47.620
The girls have yellow hair.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:53.563
Nobody in Crossways is wearing a hat.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:59.385
The people of Crossways go to bed.

00:04:59.445 --> 00:05:02.336
They wake up in the morning.

00:05:02.396 --> 00:05:05.867
A young man looks in the mirror.

00:05:05.927 --> 00:05:08.068
What has happened?

00:05:08.128 --> 00:05:10.338
Where is his hair?

00:05:10.398 --> 00:05:12.939
He has no hair!

00:05:12.999 --> 00:05:16.480
He is bald!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:21.682
The people of Crossways are angry.

00:05:21.742 --> 00:05:24.242
Everybody is bald.

00:05:24.302 --> 00:05:26.338
They have no hair.

00:05:26.398 --> 00:05:29.474
They want their hair back.

00:05:29.534 --> 00:05:32.116
Where is my hat?

00:05:32.176 --> 00:05:34.256
Where is my hat?

00:05:34.316 --> 00:05:43.480
I want my hat back.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.742
Suddenly there is a loud noise.

00:05:46.802 --> 00:05:50.704
A small boy is walking along the street.

00:05:50.764 --> 00:05:53.688
He is blowing a trumpet.

00:05:53.748 --> 00:06:04.500
He is blowing the trumpet loudly.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:09.778
The small boy is walking in front of a donkey.

00:06:09.838 --> 00:06:13.170
The donkey is pulling a cart.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:16.781
A man is sitting on the cart.

00:06:16.841 --> 00:06:21.649
The cart is full of black hats.

00:06:21.709 --> 00:06:25.318
There is a notice above the cart.

00:06:25.378 --> 00:06:28.260
Everybody reads the notice.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:35.000
They cheer and shout.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:38.520
Everybody buys a black hat.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.232
The black hats cover their bald heads.

00:06:42.292 --> 00:06:45.088
Everybody is happy.

00:06:45.148 --> 00:06:49.270
HATS FOR SALE! ALL SHAPES! ALL SIZES!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:07:02.000
HURRY! HURRY! HURRY! ONLY TWO DOLLARS!
  